They are not covered by the MIT License.

Font: the Inter font in assets/fonts/ is under the SIL Open Font License 1.1,
see assets/fonts/LICENSE-Inter.txt.

Earlier versions: versions of this repository from before November 2026 were
built on the carte-noire Jekyll theme (https://github.com/jacobtomlinson/carte-noire),
which is under GPLv3. That license still applies to those versions in the git
history.


